<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH CUP AND LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH CUP AND LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English cup and</p>
<p>league matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>F.A. Cup semifinals</p>
<p> Middlesbrough	  2   Chesterfield	     2 (extra time</p>
<p>being played)</p>
<p> Chelsea		  3   Wimbledon		  0</p>
<p>Premier league</p>
<p> Sheffield Wednesday  1    Newcastle		 1</p>
<p> Sunderland	     1    Liverpool		 2</p>
<p>Played on Saturday</p>
<p> Arsenal		   2  Leicester		  0</p>
<p> Blackburn		 2  Manchester United	3</p>
<p> Derby		     2  Aston Villa		1</p>
<p> Everton		   1  Tottenham		  0</p>
<p> Southampton	     2  West Ham		   0</p>
